er, every encounter can hold a promise, every conversation can hide an intention, and a single night can change more than you expect.If you’ve been following our development, thank you for being part of this journey. If you’re discovering the ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:05:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689922","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963380-1846651706681689","game_id":"steam-4963380","kind":"announcement","title":"Your Passage Awaits — Play the Demo Now","summary":"Dear Passenger,Your passage has been arranged. The gangway is open, the Atlantic lies ahead, and someone on board is about to become much more than a stranger.The demo of The Last Night on the Atlantic is now available on Steam.Beyond the elegant halls and polite introductions, every passenger carries something unseen: a desire, a secret, a reason to leave the past behind. As you find your place among them, consider carefully whom you let close.A lingering glance might lead to romance. A convers","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:25:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681689","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963380-1846018067933239","game_id":"steam-4963380","kind":"announcement","title":"The Last Night on the Atlantic - Dev Log","summary":"What We’ve AccomplishedThe full storyline is complete The game’s story now spans six in-game days, with the full narrative written and implemented.Story visuals and adult scenes are implemented We’ve created and integrated the static visuals for the story and adult scenes, bringing the game’s key moments to life.The Gallery is ready Players can revisit the adult scenes they’ve unlocked during their playthrough through the Gallery.Mini-games are in place We’ve developed and implemented a variety ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T13:04:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933239","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4963380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:30Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:29Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4963380":"2026-10-26T15:39:30Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4963380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:29Z"},"5361660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:30Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4963380","app_id":4963380,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"430d786ec4cea58c71537d1eaa440009c324be36c83c6705a03ef8fce32b91cd","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"1912년의 웅장한 호화 여객선에서는 모든 갑판이 하나의 비밀을 품고 있습니다. 로맨스, 마피아의 음모, 그리고 인생을 바꾸는 선택 사이에 놓인 젊은 예술가가 되어, 모든 결정이 당신의 운명을 만들어가는 스토리 중심 비주얼 노벨을 경험하세요.","publishers":[{"name":" Velvet Horizon Studios"}],"developers":[{"name":" Velvet Horizon Studios"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796025600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"The Last Night on the Atlan